{"id":"n61358-1-19","stage":3,"title":"사태 · 事态","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61358-1-19-1","ko":"경찰 당국에서 오늘 파업 중인 노조원들을 모두 잡아들일 예정이랍니다.","zh":"据说警方今天打算把所有正在罢工的工会成员都抓起来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"경찰","meaning":"警方，警察当局","explanation":"경찰：警方，警察当局","readings":[{"term":"경찰","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25949","senseId":"1","lemma":"경찰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"당국에서","meaning":"当局","explanation":"당국：当局；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"당국","audio":"/audio/d406f8a9387db7d0399b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49459","senseId":"1","lemma":"당국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"파업","meaning":"罢工","explanation":"파업：罢工","readings":[{"term":"파업","audio":"/audio/bdb9e09276960f102b68.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82415","senseId":"1","lemma":"파업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중인","meaning":"处在某状态的期间。","explanation":"중：处在某状态的期间。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"3","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노조원들을","meaning":"工会会员","explanation":"노조원：工会会员；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"노조원","audio":"/audio/c22a2be55112c26665ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42906","senseId":"1","lemma":"노조원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모두","meaning":"全部，所有","explanation":"모두：全部，所有","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64739","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잡아들일","meaning":"抓起来，逮捕","explanation":"잡아들이다：抓起来，逮捕；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"잡아들이다","audio":"/audio/fe5482aff571ba440725.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73216","senseId":"2","lemma":"잡아들이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예정이랍니다.","meaning":"预定","explanation":"예정：预定；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；랍니다：礼貌地告知自己知道或听说的事实。","readings":[{"term":"예정","audio":"/audio/8688e9ff7c84e0e44571.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66576","senseId":"1","lemma":"예정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"642315305ad78197","term":"경찰","zh":"警方，警察当局","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3","entryId":"25949","definition":"维持社会秩序、保护人民生命和财产安全；或指负责此事的国家机关。","pronunciation":["경ː찰"]},{"id":"d406f8a9387db7d0","term":"당국","zh":"当局","audio":"/audio/d406f8a9387db7d0399b.mp3","entryId":"49459","definition":"担任并负责某事的政府机关。","pronunciation":["당국"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"bdb9e09276960f10","term":"파업","zh":"罢工","audio":"/audio/bdb9e09276960f102b68.mp3","entryId":"82415","definition":"中途停止正在做的工作。","pronunciation":["파ː업"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"处在某状态的期间。","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"处在某状态的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"c22a2be55112c266","term":"노조원","zh":"工会会员","audio":"/audio/c22a2be55112c26665ed.mp3","entryId":"42906","definition":"加入工会的工人。","pronunciation":["노조원"]},{"id":"2576dfb09ecb81b9","term":"모두","zh":"全部，所有","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3","entryId":"64739","definition":"一个不剩或一个不漏的全体。","pronunciation":["모두"]},{"id":"fe5482aff571ba44","term":"잡아들이다","zh":"抓起来，逮捕","audio":"/audio/fe5482aff571ba440725.mp3","entryId":"73216","definition":"抓住并关起来。","pronunciation":["자바드리다"]},{"id":"8688e9ff7c84e0e4","term":"예정","zh":"预定","audio":"/audio/8688e9ff7c84e0e44571.mp3","entryId":"66576","definition":"提前定下或预想将来的事情。","pronunciation":["예ː정"]}],"audio":"/audio/4e2c46199a4590e95eb6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61358-1-19-2","ko":"노조원들을 자극하는 것은 파업 사태를 더욱 악화시킬 뿐입니다.","zh":"刺激工会成员只会让罢工局势更加恶化而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"노조원들을","meaning":"工会会员","explanation":"노조원：工会会员；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"노조원","audio":"/audio/c22a2be55112c26665ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42906","senseId":"1","lemma":"노조원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자극하는","meaning":"刺激","explanation":"자극하다：刺激；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"자극하다","audio":"/audio/6498739896c445b91716.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24766","senseId":"2","lemma":"자극하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것은","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"파업","meaning":"罢工","explanation":"파업：罢工","readings":[{"term":"파업","audio":"/audio/bdb9e09276960f102b68.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82415","senseId":"1","lemma":"파업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사태를","meaning":"事态，事件","explanation":"사태：事态，事件；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사태","audio":"/audio/c67fa3a9e0039189a570.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61358","senseId":"1","lemma":"사태","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더욱","meaning":"更加，进一步，越来越，愈加","explanation":"더욱：更加，进一步，越来越，愈加","readings":[{"term":"더욱","audio":"/audio/864cce43b44753efc38f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14369","senseId":"1","lemma":"더욱","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"악화시킬","meaning":"使恶化","explanation":"악화시키다：使恶化；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"악화시키다","audio":"/audio/1ffae4eef7d4eda63a45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85490","senseId":"1","lemma":"악화시키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뿐입니다.","meaning":"仅","explanation":"뿐：仅；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"뿐","audio":"/audio/445b7766f0430bce205e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66641","senseId":"1","lemma":"뿐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c22a2be55112c266","term":"노조원","zh":"工会会员","audio":"/audio/c22a2be55112c26665ed.mp3","entryId":"42906","definition":"加入工会的工人。","pronunciation":["노조원"]},{"id":"6498739896c445b9","term":"자극하다","zh":"刺激","audio":"/audio/6498739896c445b91716.mp3","entryId":"24766","definition":"使人或动物的身体或精神兴奋。","pronunciation":["자ː그카다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"bdb9e09276960f10","term":"파업","zh":"罢工","audio":"/audio/bdb9e09276960f102b68.mp3","entryId":"82415","definition":"中途停止正在做的工作。","pronunciation":["파ː업"]},{"id":"c67fa3a9e0039189","term":"사태","zh":"事态，事件","audio":"/audio/c67fa3a9e0039189a570.mp3","entryId":"61358","definition":"事情发展的状况或已发生的事情的状态。","pronunciation":["사ː태"]},{"id":"864cce43b44753ef","term":"더욱","zh":"更加，进一步，越来越，愈加","audio":"/audio/864cce43b44753efc38f.mp3","entryId":"14369","definition":"程度更深；更重。","pronunciation":["더욱"]},{"id":"1ffae4eef7d4eda6","term":"악화시키다","zh":"使恶化","audio":"/audio/1ffae4eef7d4eda63a45.mp3","entryId":"85490","definition":"使事情或状况向不好的方向发展。","pronunciation":["아콰시키다"]},{"id":"445b7766f0430bce","term":"뿐","zh":"仅","audio":"/audio/445b7766f0430bce205e.mp3","entryId":"66641","definition":"就是那样，如此而已。","pronunciation":["뿐"]}],"audio":"/audio/04ae704ff1d3ee84db32.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":6.6,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61358","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":119,"sequenceScore":6.4267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["刺激工会成员只会让罢工局势更加恶化而已。","只减少一次性用品，就能解决环境问题吗？","据说警方今天打算把所有正在罢工的工会成员都抓起来。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["刺激工会成员只会让罢工局势更加恶化而已。","据说警方今天打算把所有正在罢工的工会成员都抓起来。","只减少一次性用品，就能解决环境问题吗？"],"answer":0}]}
